# Copy to .env in the repository root if you need environment variables inside
# the container. bootstrap.sh picks it up automatically.
#
# Do NOT put API keys here. That is the whole argument of this repository:
# a key in a file on disk is a key you have already lost track of. Use ValetFS
# and `valetfs exec` instead. See docs/secrets.md.
#
# Reasonable things to put here:
# TZ=Asia/Seoul
# GIT_AUTHOR_NAME=Your Name
# GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL=you@example.com
